    "detailed_description": "<h1>JOIN THE COMMUNITY</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/81803b804b77ff1755c0545d74c1ac67.avif?t=1716210721\" /></div></p><br><h1>LEARN TO PLAY</h1><p><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/46e1c3badcec3d9ee0e5b9f9179ab0d2.avif?t=1716210721\" /></div></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>*ALL WARBAND &amp; COSMETIC DLC NOW INCLUDED IN THE MAIN GAME!*<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.poster.avif?t=1716210721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.webm?t=1716210721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><i>Warhammer Underworlds \u2013 Shadespire Edition</i> is a digital adaptation of the explosive, high-stakes, turn-based strategy tabletop game from <strong>Games Workshop</strong> that pits mighty warbands from the <strong>Age of Sigmar</strong> universe against one another in an eternal player versus player battle for Glory. Choose a warband, build your decks and carve a path to victory using <strong>dice-and-card</strong> mechanics that offer boundless strategic depth.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.poster.avif?t=1716210721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.webm?t=1716210721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ASSEMBLE YOUR WARBAND</h2>Trapped within the towering spires of the <strong>Mirrored City of Shadespire</strong>, fourteen warbands battle it out for survival - each with unique abilities and a distinct combat style. All of these warbands are now available to play in online matches, bot matches or single-player challenges, having previously been available as DLC! <br><br>Playable warbands:<br><br>Steelheart\u2019s Champions - Magore's Fiends - Garrek\u2019s Reavers - The Sepulchral Guard \u2013 Spiteclaw\u2019s Swarm \u2013 The Farstriders \u2013 The Chosen Axes \u2013 Ironskull\u2019s Boyz \u2013 Thorns of the Briar Queen \u2013 Eyes of the Nine \u2013 Drepur\u2019s Wraithcreepers \u2013 The Storm of Celestus \u2013 Stormsire\u2019s Cursebreakers \u2013 Mollog\u2019s Mob<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.poster.avif?t=1716210721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.webm?t=1716210721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFT YOUR DECK</h2>Your success is measured in Glory points - awarded for achieving objectives and vanquishing your foes. <strong>Deckbuilding</strong> is the strategic heart of <i>Warhammer Underworlds \u2013 Shadespire Edition</i>. Your <strong>20-card power deck</strong> is filled with clever gambits, powerful upgrades, and cunning spells you\u2019ll need to inflict maximum damage. Your<strong> 12-card objective deck</strong> will shape your tactical approach to a match, allowing you to score Glory by fulfilling specific conditions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.poster.avif?t=1716210721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.webm?t=1716210721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CLAIM THE SPOILS OF SHADESPIRE</h2><br>A <strong>rewarding progression</strong> system in both online matches and single-player Challenges allows you to earn cosmetic content including warband skins, deck portraits, and player titles! Only those who have proven themselves in the unforgiving streets of Shadespire will be able to claim these rewards.",
    "about_the_game": "*ALL WARBAND &amp; COSMETIC DLC NOW INCLUDED IN THE MAIN GAME!*<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.poster.avif?t=1716210721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/29e1690e80172f0026af3aee9003d4ee.webm?t=1716210721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br><br><i>Warhammer Underworlds \u2013 Shadespire Edition</i> is a digital adaptation of the explosive, high-stakes, turn-based strategy tabletop game from <strong>Games Workshop</strong> that pits mighty warbands from the <strong>Age of Sigmar</strong> universe against one another in an eternal player versus player battle for Glory. Choose a warband, build your decks and carve a path to victory using <strong>dice-and-card</strong> mechanics that offer boundless strategic depth.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.poster.avif?t=1716210721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/af204ed5aa169586f445a359f28154a6.webm?t=1716210721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ASSEMBLE YOUR WARBAND</h2>Trapped within the towering spires of the <strong>Mirrored City of Shadespire</strong>, fourteen warbands battle it out for survival - each with unique abilities and a distinct combat style. All of these warbands are now available to play in online matches, bot matches or single-player challenges, having previously been available as DLC! <br><br>Playable warbands:<br><br>Steelheart\u2019s Champions - Magore's Fiends - Garrek\u2019s Reavers - The Sepulchral Guard \u2013 Spiteclaw\u2019s Swarm \u2013 The Farstriders \u2013 The Chosen Axes \u2013 Ironskull\u2019s Boyz \u2013 Thorns of the Briar Queen \u2013 Eyes of the Nine \u2013 Drepur\u2019s Wraithcreepers \u2013 The Storm of Celestus \u2013 Stormsire\u2019s Cursebreakers \u2013 Mollog\u2019s Mob<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.poster.avif?t=1716210721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/6f5caa630e05550d92b76cca1d246325.webm?t=1716210721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CRAFT YOUR DECK</h2>Your success is measured in Glory points - awarded for achieving objectives and vanquishing your foes. <strong>Deckbuilding</strong> is the strategic heart of <i>Warhammer Underworlds \u2013 Shadespire Edition</i>. Your <strong>20-card power deck</strong> is filled with clever gambits, powerful upgrades, and cunning spells you\u2019ll need to inflict maximum damage. Your<strong> 12-card objective deck</strong> will shape your tactical approach to a match, allowing you to score Glory by fulfilling specific conditions.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.poster.avif?t=1716210721\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1022310/extras/e2b300bea7edae7f6d561e8234fc3447.webm?t=1716210721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CLAIM THE SPOILS OF SHADESPIRE</h2><br>A <strong>rewarding progression</strong> system in both online matches and single-player Challenges allows you to earn cosmetic content including warband skins, deck portraits, and player titles! Only those who have proven themselves in the unforgiving streets of Shadespire will be able to claim these rewards.",
    "short_description": "Lead your fighters to Glory in the ultimate PvP dice-and-cards strategy combat game. Warhammer Underworlds - Shadespire Edition pits mighty warbands against one another in an eternal battle for glory in the realms of the Age of Sigmar.",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Russian",
    "reviews": "\u201cIt's rare to see a game merge deckbuilding, tabletop tactics, dice, and card combat into one elegant combat system, but that's exactly what Warhammer Underworlds does, and there's huge potential for future expansion if the tabletop game is anything to go by.\u201d<br>PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cWarhammer Underworlds is an incredible tabletop game. It nails a load of elements that a lot of tabletop gamers look for. It plays fast, it\u2019s competitive, and it\u2019s quick to set up. There are deck building elements for added variety. Most importantly, it\u2019s incredibly fun, and Warhammer Underworlds Online captures all of that in a tight, digital package...\u201d<br>TechRaptor<br><br>\u201c...the title has the potential to be one of the most strategic competitive games on the market...\u201d<br>Screen Rant<br>",
